<title>HUNGARY: Richter plans 16pct '96 div vs 10pct in '95.</title>
<headline>Richter plans 16pct '96 div vs 10pct in '95.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian pharmaceuticals company Richter Gedeon Rt said on Friday that its management would propose paying a 16 percent dividend or 160 forints per share on ordinary stocks on the 1996 results.</p>
<p>Richter paid a 10 percent dividend on ordinary shares after the 1995 results.</p>
<p>Holders of preference shares will receive an unchanged 12 percent dividend.</p>
<p>Richter will hold its annual shareholders meeting on April 29.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
